:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T14:58:27-07:00","id":1093841,"title":"","content":"There's a boggan named Megan that's one of the siochain in Isles of the Mighty, yeap, you're quite right. Also on no mechanics (just suggests that they have maxed out or near maxed out in all arts and realms as needs be).<br /> <br /> edit: There's otherwise Dice in Kithbook Eshu (which, bleeeagh, but that's something else) and a Liam in Autumn People that may have once been such, but fell from grace to the point of becoming Dauntain. There's all the same no mechanics for it in either.<br /> <br /> I'd find it cool if the state of being was ever given a fleshed out exploration, but it doesn't seem in the cards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","user":"MarkK","date":". 05-17-2017, 06:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12141-markk","name":"MarkK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T17:16:23-07:00","id":1093907,"title":"","content":"We don't know what's in the cards other than Book of Freeholds and KB: Boggan, if people keep bringing up stuff they'd like to see maybe it will be in a book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}